# Alert Delete Standard

ก่อนสร้างหรือแก้ไข Alert ยืนยันการลบ ต้องอ่านไฟล์นี้ก่อนเสมอ

## Layout

- Popup background must always be white.
- Popup must have a rounded border using the system Error/Delete color.
- Header uses one row: delete icon beside the caption `ยืนยันการลบข้อมูล`.
- Delete icon is red and inside a small light-red box.
- The selected record must be shown in a separate information bar.
- The information bar uses a light-red background.
- Show a warning that deleted data cannot be restored.
- Add a divider before the footer buttons.
- Cancel and Delete buttons must be on the same row.

## Colors

- Border, delete icon, header caption, information bar accent, and Delete button use the system Error/Delete color.
- Cancel uses a plain TextButton.
- Do not use a dark or theme-colored Popup background.

## Behavior

- Ask for confirmation before deleting.
- Delete only after the user presses the Delete button.
- Respect screen permission and backend authorization.
- On API failure, show a user-readable description, not only an exception name or HTTP status.
